SUMMARY:Pat Metheny: Side-Eye III+
LOCATION:Academy of Music\, 274 Main St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:DSP Shows presents\n20-time Grammy Award–winning guitarist an
 d composer Pat Metheny returns with Side-Eye III+\, his largest ensemble i
 n over a decade—joined by Joe Dyson (drums)\, Chris Fishman (keyboards)\
 , Jermaine Paul (bass)\, and Leonard Patton (percussion & vocals). Anchore
 d by Metheny’s first ensemble studio album in six years\, Side-Eye III+\
 , the show features expansive new compositions alongside bold reimaginings
  of favorites and classics from his catalog. The result is a powerful\, fo
 rward-looking performance that highlights Metheny’s ongoing evolution wh
 ile honoring the sound that has defined his legendary career.\nhttps://aom
 theatre.com/aom_event/pat-metheny-side-eye-iii/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass
 : https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://aomtheatre.com/aom_event/pat-metheny-side-eye-iii/
END:VEVENT
